   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Red eye: is it VISION THREATENING?",
   "lines": [
    "red flag symptoms: blurred vision that does not clear with blinking · SEVERE pain · photophobia · coloured halos",
    "red flag signs: ↓ acuity · ciliary flush · corneal opacity · abnormal pupil · shallow chamber · ↑ pressure · proptosis",
    "ask: contact lenses (swim, sleep, shower in them?) · discharge · itch · recent cold · trauma"
   ]
  },
